{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardpoint</strong> is a top-down arcade shooter where you control a platform of four guns, each one able to upgrade into specialized roles along a shared skill tree. Each gun on the platform can be individually customized, and selecting upgrades of the same class will grant additional abilities and bonuses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The platform will constantly drain energy. More powerful upgrades will increase the rate of energy drain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns will automatically fire towards the cursor. Upgrade stats like fire rate and aim speed to defeat the increasing amount of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade guns along the same tree(s) to specialize their abilities and unlock unique abilities and bonuses. Or, upgrade along different trees and diversify your approach to clear each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defeating enemies will drop power cells that can be used to restore energy and purchase upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 15 arenas to win. Each arena is less than one minute, but each one will be harder than the last. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ skills. each one granting unique abilities and bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 classes, each giving stat boosts and modifiers to your platform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack by glaciaere</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627520?t=1749735267","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627520?t=1749735267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627520/63d13abac34c85b9fd6537f7aba9b5c4dffd45ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749735267"